{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §3.3.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2"
  description: "Each import adds a member to pet's family pinning \"cat\", and each is valid alone. Importing both puts `cat` and `kitten` in one family that a value cannot dispatch over, so the importer is refused: a family is judged over the closure that holds it."
  meta: "meta.tn"
  import: ["core.tn" "fixtures/link-pet-cats.tn" "fixtures/link-pet-kittens.tn"]
  error: { category: resolver }
}
